  "title": "Bluetooth: print event code for unknown HCI events",
  "description": "Wireshark shows \"Unknown 0x08x\" for unknown HCI Events. This merge requests adds the actual event code, e.g \"Unknown (0x6E)\".\n\nWhile this change looks like a good idea in general, it becomes way more beneficial when a stack uses custom events internally like BlueKitchen's BTstack.",
